We need to escape double quotes inside the string. In JSON, we need to escape each double quote with \". Also need to escape backslashes. The href contains %3C etc which are fine as they are part of the string; we need to escape the double quotes around the whole string.

We'll wrap the whole content in double quotes, escaping internal double quotes.

