"# Vibrant Responsive Game\n\nA simple web game that features:\n\n- Responsive canvas that scales to any screen size.\n- Emoji favicon.\n- Vibrant color palette.\n- High score saved in LocalStorage.\n- Speedrun timer in the top corner.\n- Simple sound effects using the Web Audio API.\n\n## How to Run\n\n1. Open `index.html` in a browser.\n2. Grant consent when prompted.\n3. Click the moving square to earn points.\n4. Watch the timer and high score update.\n\n## Features Implemented\n\n- **Responsive Canvas**: The canvas automatically resizes to fill the viewport.\n- **Emoji Favicon**: A rocket emoji is used as the favicon.\n- **Vibrant Palette**: Uses bright colors defined in `config/palette.js`.\n- **LocalStorage High Score**: Persists across page reloads.\n- **Sound Effects**: Simple beeps via Web Audio API.\n- **Speedrun Timer**: Displays elapsed time in the top-left corner.\n\n## Safety Considerations\n\nUser consent is required before any gameplay actions. The game checks for consent via `safetyService` and blocks interactions until consent is given.\n\n## License\n\nMIT"

